/fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t3-ehp0116-000039" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>Adjusted LSGM concentrations (95% confidence intervals) of BPA (&#x003bc;g/L) in various demographic groups.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Variable</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">LSGM (95% CI)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Sex</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Male</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.6 (2.4&#x02013;2.8)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Female</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.9 (2.6&#x02013;3.2)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Race/ethnicity</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Mexican American</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.3 (2.0&#x02013;2.7)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Non-Hispanic white</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.7 (2.5&#x02013;2.9)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;Non-Hispanic black</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.0 (2.6&#x02013;3.4)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Age (years)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;6&#x02013;11</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.5 (3.9&#x02013;5.1)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;12&#x02013;19</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.0 (2.7&#x02013;3.4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x02265; 20</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.5 (2.3&#x02013;2.7)</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" align="left" rowspan="1">Income</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x0003c; $20,000</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3.1 (2.7&#x02013;3.5)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;$20,000&#x02013;$45,000</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.8 (2.6&#x02013;3.1)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x02003;&#x0003e; $45,000</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2.5 (2.3&#x02013;2.7)</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t4-ehp0116-000039" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Observed statistical significance values for differences between adjusted LSGM concentrations of BPA for various demographic groups.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Difference</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>p</italic>-Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Females vs. males</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.043</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mexican Americans vs. non-Hispanic whites</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.007</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mexican Americans vs. non-Hispanic blacks</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.006</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Non-Hispanic whites vs. non-Hispanic blacks</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.21</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Children vs. adolescents</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x0003c; 0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Children vs. adults</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x0003c; 0.001</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Adolescents vs. adults</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.003</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x0003c; $20,000 vs. $20,000&#x02013;$45,000</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.17</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x0003c; $20,000 vs. &#x0003e; $45,000</td><td align="center" ro